</div>
<div class="fb" id="fb-c1b2"></div>
</div><div class="q-card" id="c1b3">
<div class="q-body"><div class="q-text">Who built the first mechanical computer called the "Difference Engine"?</div></div>
<div class="opts"><button class="opt" data-mcq="c1b3" data-c="A"><span class="opt-l">A</span>Alan Turing</button>
